            "key": "solution",
            "html": "<p>Не­ра­вен­ство рав­но­силь­но со­во­куп­но­сти:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}x^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x-\\frac{13}{6}\\ge 2x^{2}+\\frac{8}{3}x-\\frac{11}{6}\\\\-x^{2}-\\frac{4}{3}x+\\frac{13}{6}\\ge 2x^{2}+\\frac{8}{3}x-\\frac{11}{6}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x+\\frac{1}{3}\\le 0\\\\3x^{2}+4x-4\\le 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff\"></span> </p></center><center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"4b142552-b23a-4ae4-a851-17c3bf964e7e\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/4b142552-b23a-4ae4-a851-17c3bf964e7e\"/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}3x^{2}+4x+1\\le 0\\\\3x^{2}+4x-4\\le 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}3(x+1)(x+\\frac{1}{3})\\le 0\\\\3(x+2)(x-\\frac{2}{3})\\le 0\\end{aligned}\\right.\\iff -2\\le x\\le \\frac{2}{3}\"></span> . </p></center>",
